# Loaded by `vite build` (npm run build) — the worldsoccersim.org build.
#
# Committed on purpose. Vite inlines `import.meta.env.VITE_*` at build time, so
# these have to exist wherever the build runs, and every place that could hold
# them out-of-band is a place they can be silently lost: they lived in the
# Vercel project, the 2026-08-15 move to Cloudflare left them behind, and
# production shipped a bundle carrying `posthog.init(undefined)` for five days.
# Nothing throws and nothing logs when that happens — the site just reports no
# pageviews, no gameplay events and no crashes while looking perfectly healthy.
#
# Keeping the values in the repo means any checkout builds a working bundle
# with no dashboard configuration anywhere, which is the only version of this
# that cannot be lost again in a host migration.
#
# Safe to commit: VITE_POSTHOG_KEY is PostHog's public project API key. It is
# write-only, and it is already served to every visitor inside the JS bundle.
VITE_POSTHOG_KEY=phc_nqhYqPRCqWKbvbmWV4Nqs4NzmVP2xA8fUgtAMdGnF9FZ

# The US ingestion endpoint, not the app URL (us.posthog.com).
VITE_POSTHOG_HOST=https://us.i.posthog.com

# Optional. URL of the community roster file offered as a download on the
# Import Custom League screen (src/ui/rosterDownload.ts).
#
# Left unset until a host is chosen, which renders no download link at all —
# the screen falls back to "write one yourself or generate one with the AI
# prompt", exactly as it read before. Set it to an http(s) URL to turn the
# link on; anything else is ignored and treated as unset.
#
# It is a URL rather than a bundled file on purpose. The game ships fictional
# clubs (docs/eafc-import.md), so a file of real clubs and players stays off
# this repo and out of every build, and the link can be withdrawn by clearing
# this one value instead of patching three storefronts.
#
# Hosted as a GitHub release asset on this repo rather than committed. The file
# is not in the git tree and not in any bundle; only the release holds it, so
# withdrawing it means deleting one release asset and clearing this line.
VITE_ROSTER_DOWNLOAD_URL=https://github.com/proelium27/soccer-gm/releases/download/rosters-2026-09/real-players-teams.json
